LineageOS 16.0:

1. Removed the built-in input method and browser, replaced with Via and Gboard respectively;

2. Removed redundant VNDK libraries: vndk28, vndk-sp28, vndk26, and vndk-sp26 under system/lib and system/lib64 directories;

3. Removed binary files of vendor.huawei.hardware.biometrics.hwfacerecognize, vendor.huawei.hardware.tp, vendor.huawei.hardware.sensors, vendor.huawei.hardware.power, vendor.huawei.hardware.otherdevices, vendor.huawei.hardware.light, vendor.huawei.hardware.hwfactoryinterface, and vndk-sp26 @x.x-service;

4. Removed Huawei vendor HALs (see point 3);

5. Removed corresponding HAL startup scripts (see point 3).

LineageOS 17.1:

1. Removed the built-in input method and browser, replaced with Via and Gboard respectively;

2. Removed redundant VNDK libraries: vndk26, vndk-sp26, vndk28, vndk-sp28, vndk29, and vndk-sp29 under system/lib and system/lib64 directories;

3. Based on lineup16.0 vendor version, most Huawei services declared in /vendor/manifest.xml manifest file have been removed;

4. Fixed user interface frame rate issues.

lineage-17.1-20210805 unofficial stable version has been released.

